// @apply follow the respelling in 32 node string properties
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:'M4.0'}) SET n.q_0_embodied_thrownness = 'M4-0\'s ground is Dasein\'s embodied awareness — the body-consciousness implicit in all experience, prior to any reading of it. Manifesting #0 (Ground) within Nara, it is the pre-reflective floor from which every Nara operation departs: medicine, oracle, transformation and lens all presuppose a *whose* before they can act. Its void-pole is the thrown-ness itself — the unchosen natal fact, this birth at this instant under these heavens, the \'compassionate sensitivity to origins\' (#4 coreNature) taken as bedrock rather than achievement. M4.0 is the one stable layer of the whole personal field: per the architecture spec it is \'stable, not mutable from daily activity\' — daily perturbation reaches #4.4.4.4, never M4.0. The identity matrix is read but not re-written, the .rodata of a life. Before the question of who one is becoming, the silent given of who one was thrown as.', n.q_1_sixfold_identity_matrix = 'What M4.0 IS: the complete 6-fold archetypal personality matrix — universal pattern made *this person* through birthdate encoding and converging typologies. Its substance is six layers (internalStructure): #4.0-0 Birthdate/Pythagorean derivation (name+date refracted through the 12 MEF lenses into an elemental quaternion contribution — \'numeric/archetypal light\' before it is any typology); #4.0-1 Astrological chart (natal anchors sun/moon/asc/mc on the 720 clock, all ten planet degrees); #4.0-2 Jungian layer (nucleotide_balance A/T/C/G ↔ Cups/Wands/Pentacles/Swords ↔ Feeling/iNtuition/Sensation/Thinking, MBTI 4-bit); #4.0-3 Gene Keys (the M3 hexagram bitboard indexed by activation); #4.0-4 Human Design (type/authority/profile/incarnation cross); #4.0-5 Quintessence, the BLAKE3 hash of present layers synthesising all into one signature. Seven sacred systems converge on a single embodied identity. The substrate locks each layer\'s byte-size at compile time (m4.h static asserts) — the matrix refuses drift.', n.q_2_birthdate_encoding_operation = 'M4.0 operates by *encoding* — the act that transforms abstract archetype into personal equation. Its engine is the birthdate-encoding pass: name/date material → QL numeric light → mod6 position + inverse → mod12 chromatic/MEF anchoring → full 12×6 refraction → L2\' alchemical-elemental extraction → an elemental quaternion that retains its whole evidence-path (never flattened to \'Frank = 6\'). Relationally it is the resonance *counterparty*: q_personal, the Kerykeion-natal quaternion, is precisely what the kernel reads against q_cosmic to compute whether the current cosmic state coheres with WHO this person is (E4, the Nara personal-resonance energy, weight 4). The how is calibration-from-origin: not imposing a type but running ten planets through the dignity ladder (domicile/exaltation/detriment/fall) to weigh an elemental balance that is *this* chart and no other. Identity here is a derivation that keeps its proof.', n.q_3_convergent_typological_lattice = 'Structurally M4.0 is a convergence-lattice: seven independent symbolic systems (Pythagorean number, natal astrology, Jung/MBTI, Gene Keys, Human Design, decanic correspondence, the elemental quaternion) made to address one point. Its pattern is the matrix\'s `layer_presence` bitmask — identity assembled from whichever layers are present, the quintessence recomputed from present layers only (`m4_identity_hash_compute`), so the form holds at any degree of completion. The deeper structural law is convergence-without-collapse: P-position complementarity (sums to 5: 0/5, 1/4, 2/3) and Klein V4 lens-squares organise the refraction so that multiple typologies enrich rather than overwrite each other. The matrix is a held superposition of readings, integrated at #4.0-5 only at the elemental-quaternionic level — never reduced to a single root. Many lights, one prism, no flattening.', n.q_4_who_before_journey = 'M4-0\'s telos is to be the *from-whom* — the ground the entire Nara journey departs from and the configuration it returns to enrich. Its why is the on-ramp of the whole product (marketing framing): the user \'starts at 4.0\', the identity matrix as \'personal psychological computer setup\' that \'configures the system to them, but also configures them to themselves\'. This is not a personality quiz but a constitutional mapping — \'identity has a topology\', a circulation pattern with characteristic rhythm, blind spots, and points of recursive depth: \'it isn\'t telling you what you are, it\'s showing you how you move through knowing.\' Contextually M4.0 grounds every later position: medicine selects remedy *for this body*, oracle reads *for this querent*, transformation places *this self* in cycle. Every Nara \'why\' presupposes this archetypal \'that there is a this-one\'. Know your shape, before you move it.', n.q_5_quintessence_handed_forward = 'M4-0\'s synthesis is #4.0-5 — the Identity Quintessence where all six layers integrate at the elemental quaternionic level into one BLAKE3 signature, and hand that signature forward as the stable q_identity the rest of Nara composes against (`Q_composed = Q_identity · Q_transit · Q_activity`). Read as Nara\'s own position-0, the completion here is the *giving of a ground*: the matrix perfects who-one-is-archetypally and passes it as the from-which medicine, oracle, transformation and lens all begin. And because M4.0 is the stable pole untouched by daily flux, its return is the deepest Möbius of the personal field — the journey out through #4.4.4.4 always rejoins the one who was thrown, now recognised. The quintessence does not finish a life; it inaugurates one. The matrix\'s last act is to be the first ground every morning stands on.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:'M4.1'}) SET n.q_1_sympathetic_correspondence_system = 'What M4.1 IS: the comprehensive 6-fold medical-magical system that translates archetypal identity into material remedy through sympathetic correspondence. Its substance (internalStructure) is six layers: #4.1-0 Elemental Ground (4/5-element potentiation — fire/earth/air/water/quintessence as the somatic floor); #4.1-1 Energy-Body Architecture (nadis, meridians, chakras, organ networks as one integrated map); #4.1-2 Materia & Reagents (Paracelsian signatures, herbs, metals — the decanic DECAN_HERBS/DECAN_BODY_PARTS correspondences keyed per decan); #4.1-3 Operations & Techne (alchemical operations as therapeutic *verbs*); #4.1-4 Temporal Astrological Intelligence; #4.1-5 Integration/Safety/Feedback. It fuses East and West — TCM and Ayurveda with Paracelsian signature-doctrine and Hermetic correspondence — into one personalised protocol. The substrate carries it as `M4_Sympathetic_Medicine`, `M4_Elemental_Balance`, `M4_Chakra_State`, `M4_Medicine_Triage` (fire/water/earth/air intensities → dominant+deficient element → primary chakra → triage vector). Body as a chord that can be re-tuned.', n.q_2_decanic_timing_operation = 'M4.1 operates by *timed sympathetic resonance* — the right substance at the right cosmic moment. Its central operator is the Temporal Astrological Intelligence (#4.1-4), the timing authority for ALL Nara operations: planetary hours, lunar phases, decan transits, annual profections, zodiacal releasing — \'maximizing efficacy while minimizing resistance.\' Relationally it is the practical descent of the oracle\'s meaning and the identity\'s pattern into matter: it \'receives levers from energetics\' and converts archetype to remedy through the decanic chain (planet → elemental signature → chakra → CHAKRA_BODY_ZONES body-zone). The how is dignity-weighted elemental triage: the same ten-planet dignity ladder M4.0 uses for identity here reads the *current* elemental deficiency and prescribes toward balance, where quintessence/Akasha emerges from low variance across the four elements. Medicine as chronobiology raised to the sacred — not what to take, but what to take *now*.', n.q_3_elemental_ground_architecture = 'Structurally M4.1 is a correspondence-architecture: a fixed lattice of sympathetic mappings that any body-state can be routed through. Its pattern is the convergence of every route on a single LUT — planet, decan, and tarot-derived signature all arrive at CHAKRA_BODY_ZONES[8], indexed by chakra id, so the materia, the energy-body, and the temporal layer are three faces of one indexed map (DECAN_BODY_PARTS[36], DECAN_HERBS[36], PLANET_CHAKRA[8], ELEMENT_CHAKRA[5], SIGN_ELEMENT[12]). The elemental ground (#4.1-0) is the structural floor — four elements plus the quintessence that emerges from their balance — onto which the chakra-and-organ networks (#4.1-1) are stretched. The form is animistic-but-rigorous: every correspondence is traceable (signature → element → chakra → zone), no remedy without a path. The body is a structured instrument whose strings are the elements and whose frets are the decans.', n.q_4_restoring_resonant_health = 'M4-1\'s telos is the restoration of resonant health — the why is sympathetic correspondence in service of *this* body\'s coherence with the cosmos it lives inside. Its purpose is bounded by an ethic the spec makes structural: safety through titration and contraindication awareness (#4.1-5), guardrails and outcome-tracking that keep the magical from becoming the reckless. Contextually M4.1 is the material-definitional seat of Nara — where the abstract identity of M4.0 must prove itself in substance, and where the oracle\'s symbolic guidance (M4.2) finds a body to land in. It answers the \'what\' of the personal field: what materia, what chakra, what elemental adjustment, at what planetary hour. The deeper why is participation: to be well is to vibrate in tune with the correspondence-web one is woven from. Health is not a state to acquire but a resonance to recover.', n.q_5_remedy_returned_to_transformation = 'M4-1\'s synthesis is #4.1-5 Integration/Safety/Feedback — where the prescribed remedy is metabolised, titrated, tracked, and its outcome fed back as evidence. Read as Nara\'s position-1 within the wider cycle, its completion hands the material lever forward: the somatic-elemental current it computes becomes the constraint M4.3 transformation works *within* (\'receives material constraints from #4.1\'), and the chakra-and-element state it reads becomes the body the two-stroke process must honour so change stays grounded, never bypassed. The Möbius here is the feedback loop made sacred — every remedy\'s outcome re-enters the elemental balance, so tomorrow\'s triage begins from a body the last treatment already shifted. Medicine completes not when the symptom clears but when the correspondence re-closes: the body, re-tuned, becomes fresh ground. The cure\'s last act is to hand the lever to the work.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:'M4.2'}) SET n.q_1_multi_traditional_oracle_system = 'What M4.2 IS: the comprehensive 6-fold divinatory system — multiple symbolic languages for sacred dialogue. Its substance (internalStructure) is six layers: #4.2-0 Common Substrate (the symbol-ontology bridge to Mahamaya, emitting standardised canonical tags other Nara subsystems can act on); #4.2-1 Tarot Engines (Marseille, Rider-Waite-Smith, Thoth, and bespoke decks with QL semantics — the Thoth+Golden-Dawn deck the substrate confirms, suit↔nucleotide A/T/C/G, court and pip decan-mappings); #4.2-2 I-Ching (3-coin casting A=6/T=9/C=8/G=7, 64 hexagrams with concrescence mapping and HEXAGRAM_BODY_DYNAMICS); #4.2-3 Casting/Randomness (RNG seeding + consent); #4.2-4 Interpretation (rule-based correspondence fused with generative commentary); #4.2-5 Divinatory Hygiene/Pedagogy. The substrate carries it as `M4_IChing_Cast`, `M4_Tarot_Draw`, `M4_Sacred_Random`, `M4_Oracle_Draw`, `M4_Canonical_Tag` — the tag-payload bridging oracle → medicine → transformation. Many tongues, one symbolic substrate: I-Ching and Tarot are duals over the 64-fold codon space.', n.q_2_translating_pattern_to_guidance = 'M4.2 operates as Nara\'s energetic-relational *operator* — the act of translating cosmic pattern into comprehensible symbolic guidance. Its motion is the draw: a question meets a seeded cast, the fall maps to QL positions (the 6-card quaternary draw mapping directly to positions 0–5 with calibrated resonances), and the interpretation layer (#4.2-4) reads it through both rule and intuition. Relationally it is the *production* of meaning that the rest of Nara consumes: it emits canonical tags that \'enable direct action by other Nara subsystems\' — the oracle speaks and medicine triages, transformation cycles, the lens annotates. The how is dia-logos, not monologue: per #4 doctrine, divination is sacred conversation, the Transcendent Function mediating conscious–unconscious through symbolic engagement. This is the P2 operation of the personal field — where the static identity of M4.0 and the materia of M4.1 become a living question answered in symbols *now*.', n.q_3_quaternary_draw_architecture = 'Structurally M4.2 is a translation-architecture: a common symbol-substrate (#4.2-0) beneath multiple oracle engines, so that Tarot, I-Ching and emergent methods are interchangeable refractions of one underlying QL grammar. Its pattern is the quaternary mapping — a draw is not a list of cards but a placement onto the 0–5 cycle, each position carrying a calibrated resonance, the 12-Fold Concrescence tracking transformation through Sum/Difference value sequences. The deep structural law is the codon-duality the marketing source names: DNA, I-Ching and Tarot resolved as \'a unified symbolic-genetic system\' built from the classical coin-values of the toss — all 64-fold (or −8) systems, with the hexagram and the Mahāmāyā Tarot as duals. The form is rule-plus-portal: deterministic correspondence (#4.2-4 rules) wrapped around an irreducibly open aperture (#4.2-3 randomness). A lattice with a hole at its centre, through which the unpredictable speaks.', n.q_4_ways_of_knowing = 'M4-2\'s telos is to honour *multiple ways of knowing* — the why is that different temperaments reach truth through different symbolic doors, and a single oracle would be a single tyranny. Its purpose is bounded by Divinatory Hygiene (#4.2-5): bias-checks, journaling, dia-logos transparency, and an ethic that \'respects free will\' so the oracle \'serves growth and empowerment rather than dependency.\' Contextually M4.2 is the operational seat of Nara — the place where the personal field stops being a static configuration and becomes an event, a question put and answered. It answers the \'how\' of personal guidance: how to receive counsel through symbol, how to establish sacred dialogue with cosmic intelligence. The deeper why is recognition over prediction: the oracle exists not to foreclose the future but to mirror the querent\'s situation back so clearly that they recognise the move that was already theirs to make. Pratyabhijñā dealt as cards.', n.q_5_tagged_meaning_handed_on = 'M4-2\'s synthesis is #4.2-5 Hygiene/Pedagogy folding back into #4.2-0\'s canonical-tag emission — the reading sealed, journaled, and crystallised into a tag-payload that hands meaning forward. Read as Nara\'s position-2, its completion is the *passing of the read*: the `M4_Canonical_Tag` bridges oracle → medicine → transformation, so the symbol drawn becomes the lever M4.1 prescribes and the meaning M4.3 cycles. The Möbius here is the two-stroke doctrine in miniature — the outer stroke is the draw (codon/manifest), but the oracle only completes when its inner stroke lands: the querent integrates the symbol, journals the recognition, and the next question begins from a self the last reading already moved. Divination completes not at the turn of the card but at the close of the dialogue — when the symbol, metabolised, becomes ground for the asking that follows. The oracle\'s last word is a tag the rest of the life can act on.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:'M4.3'}) SET n.q_1_two_stroke_process_engine = 'What M4.3 IS: Nara\'s central process engine, the Two-Stroke Process Engine (Model A′) that actually *changes state*. Its substance (internalStructure) is six concerting components: #4.3-0 Cycle Engine (encoding QL mod-6 into 12/24-phase traversal — placing the user at a precise position in their transformation journey); #4.3-1 Operational Grammar (the canonical alchemical *verbs*: calcination, dissolution, separation, conjunction, the Major-Arcana correspondences as consciousness-transmutation operators); #4.3-2 Dialogical & Inquiry Containers (first-class mediators); #4.3-3 Control/Chaos & Safety (thresholds, pacing); #4.3-4 Protocol Library (storey-specific recipes); #4.3-5 Telemetry & Phase History (outcomes for learning). The substrate carries `M4_Transform_State` (alchemical operation index, stroke phase, cycle count, container active, decan recipe index, arousal level, safety threshold). It receives oracular meaning from M4.2 and material levers from M4.1 and converts them into enacted change. Transformation as collaborative emergence, not imposed conversion.', n.q_2_dialogical_container_mediation = 'M4.3 operates by *mediated enactment* — change happens inside a container, never by direct fiat. Its operators are the dialogical containers (#4.3-2), \'first-class transformation mediators\' that are living vessels rather than interpretive tools: Bohmian Dialogue (assumption-suspension, shared-meaning emergence — best for polarization/gridlock); Native Talking Circle (sacred ritual container, talking-stick — best for community healing/grief); Diamond Approach Inquiry (precise phenomenological exploration — best for identity-knots/defenses). Relationally M4.3 is the convergence-point of the personal field: it \'receives meaning from divination, levers from energetics, places user in cycles, and changes state.\' The how is the alchemical operation enacted *within* the chosen container and gated by safety — the operational grammar (#4.3-1) supplies the verb, the container supplies the vessel, the cycle engine supplies the position. These containers \'mediate transformation—they do not provide oracles but create conditions for change.\' The operation is the meeting, not the instruction.', n.q_3_cycle_engine_pattern = 'Structurally M4.3 is a process-architecture — the pattern-position of the whole personal field, exactly as #3 is the pattern-archetype. Its form is the Cycle Engine (#4.3-0): QL mod-6 encoded into a 12/24-phase traversal, so that any transformation is locatable as a *position in a journey* (\'I\'m at 4.3.2 right now — the pattern-recognition phase of my inquiry\' — coordinate-as-phenomenological-orientation per the marketing source). The deep structural law is the codon/anticodon doubling: each phase is itself two-stroked, the outer-then-inner rhythm fractally nested into every step, which is why the engine maps mod-6 onto a *doubled* 12-fold rather than a flat 6. The pattern is recipe-plus-rhythm: a Protocol Library (#4.3-4) of storey-specific packets, each honouring the breath, each gated by Control/Chaos & Safety (#4.3-3). The form is a spiral that breathes — process not as a line of operations but as a rhythm of manifest-and-integrate, tracked by telemetry so the spiral learns its own shape.', n.q_4_change_through_mediation_not_imposition = 'M4-3\'s telos is change that *holds* — the why is transformation as collaborative emergence, the human met as a participant in their own becoming rather than a substrate to be reprogrammed. Its purpose is structurally guarded by the epistemic separation #4 insists on: M4.3 *does* (transformation), M4.4 *understands* (interpretation), and the two must never conflate — \'Jung and Trika appear in transformation protocols only as metadata tags for pedagogical reference, never as operational nodes\', so traditions inform the work without dictating it. Contextually M4.3 is the processual seat of Nara, the central intelligence (the architecture spec names it the \'logical-intelligence engine\' producing the PatternPacket). It answers the \'which\': which cycle-position, which alchemical verb, which container, which safety threshold. The deeper why is sustainability — a change metabolised through lived dialogue lasts; a change imposed rebounds. The work is real only if the person walked it.', n.q_5_metabolised_change_handed_to_context = 'M4-3\'s synthesis is #4.3-5 Telemetry & Phase History — where the completed two-stroke is recorded, its outcome captured, and the phase-history fed forward as context and pedagogy. Read as Nara\'s position-3, its completion hands the metabolised change onward: the enacted transformation becomes the event M4.4 names, frames and records (without re-performing it), and the telemetry becomes the raw material M4-5\'s Logos Cycle distils into insight and playbook. The Möbius here is the inner stroke writ large — transformation completes only when its anticodon lands, when the change is digested and sealed, and that sealed change re-enters as altered ground: the next cycle begins from a self the last operation actually moved. Process completes not at the operation\'s end but at integration\'s close — when the manifest has been metabolised and becomes the floor the next phase stands on. The engine\'s last act is to hand the lens a change worth understanding.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:'M4.4'}) SET n.q_0_lens_shelf_ground = 'M4-4\'s ground is the interpretive distance itself — the standing-back from which transformation can be *seen* without being touched. Manifesting #4 (Context/Lemniscate) within Nara, it is the one child that re-runs Nara\'s own #4-nature: the frame-within-the-frame, where the personal field folds inward to make sense of what it just did. Its ground is the epistemic separation #4 holds as law: \'doing\' belongs to M4.3, \'meaning-making\' belongs here, and conflating them is the cardinal error. Before any lens is applied, the recognition that understanding is not operation — that a tradition can illuminate a change without dictating it, that to name a process is a different act from performing it. This is the context ledger\'s first principle: the work and the reading of the work are two, and keeping them two is what lets wisdom inform without imposing. The mirror must not reach into the room it reflects.', n.q_1_six_epistemic_traditions = 'What M4.4 IS: the context ledger and lens-shelf — the place where schools, lineages and thinkers live as interpretive frameworks rather than operators. Its substance (internalStructure) is six epistemic traditions, each a distinct way of reading transformation: #4.4-0 Gebser (structures of consciousness — archaic/magic/mythic/mental/integral); #4.4-1 Comparative Ontology; #4.4-2 Epistemology/Hermeneutics; #4.4-3 Jung/Depth Psychology (as *pure interpretive lens* — the individuation reading, never an operational node); #4.4-4 Phenomenology; #4.4-5 Trika/Kashmir Śaivism (the tantric interpretive frame, Siva-Shakti recognition). Each lens \'maintains reflection tables translating core transformation dynamics into tradition-specific language\' — the same change rendered in six vocabularies. And the same shelf holds the *contextual arena*: the life-domains and records through which a person\'s transformations are framed and preserved. Six mirrors angled at one process, and a ledger that remembers.', n.q_2_naming_framing_recording = 'M4.4 operates by *naming, framing and recording* — the act of contextualisation that \'makes sense of what #4.3 does and maintains records.\' Its motion is interpretation-without-enactment: a transformation completes in M4.3, and M4.4 reads it through one or several lenses, annotates it temporally, and files it in the context ledger. Relationally it is the meaning-membrane of the personal field: it receives the metabolised change from M4.3 and the telemetry it produced, and renders them legible across traditions — multi-perspectival interpretation, cross-cultural wisdom integration, case documentation. The how is reflection-table translation: each lens has a mapping from the universal transformation-dynamic to its own idiom, so the user can hear their experience in Jung\'s voice, in Gebser\'s, in Trika\'s, and recognise it as one event seen severally. This is the lemniscate\'s characteristic turn — not advancing the process but folding back over it to deepen it. To understand is to circle, not to push.', n.q_3_lemniscate_nesting_architecture = 'Structurally M4.4 is the lemniscate made architecture — the #4-within-#4, the figure-eight where Nara\'s personal field folds inward on itself. Its pattern carries the deepest nesting in the whole map: M4 → M4.4 → M4-4-4 → M4-4-4-4, the lemniscate-at-the-lemniscate-at-the-lemniscate-at-the-lemniscate, where the protected personal-Pratibimba lives. #4.4.4.4 is the \'living update target\': daily activity perturbs *here* through Q_activity and reviewed proposals, but never mutates M4.0 — \'complete phenomenological recursion.\' Its three-layer structure (personalPratibimbaArchitecture) is the privacy engine: (1) canonical Bimba layer of timeless patterns shared by all; (2) PCO/Pratibimba overlay of per-user lived experience in fenced local storage; (3) Archetype Atlas of depersonalised patterns for collective learning with no narrative or PII. The form is fractal self-containment: each individual a complete reflection (pratibimba) of universal structure (Anuttara). The frame nests until a single life becomes a world.', n.q_4_world_the_user_amasses = 'M4-4\'s telos is to be the *where* of the personal field — the frame that holds meaning, the place a life accumulates into a world. Its why is the lemniscate\'s reason for being: when a transformation is too rich for a single reading, M4.4 opens a fresh interpretive cycle to hold it, the recovery that re-animates rather than forecloses. This is the UX heart of the product (marketing source): the user \'amasses details in #4.4.4.4 and this becomes their world\' — each recursive descent \'a genuine discovery, not a gamified progression\', the coordinate notation itself a phenomenological map of where one stands in one\'s own inquiry. Contextually M4.4 is Nara\'s #4 seat doubled — the teleological-contextual position holding the paradox open (Jung\'s transcendent function) without forcing it shut. The deeper why is grounded shared context: per the source, Epi-Logos offers \'a grounded and shared context frame for all its users, born into the system via the #4 branch.\' Meaning is not stated; it is located — and a located life is a world.', n.q_5_world_opened_to_epii = 'M4-4\'s synthesis is the fork the lemniscate always faces: integrate, or nest deeper. Read as Nara\'s position-4, its completion is the moment the accumulated world — the context ledger, the #4.4.4.4 pratibimba, the multi-lens record — is either folded into a still-finer cycle or handed up to M4.5 for the Logos Cycle to distil. The Möbius here is the deepest in the personal field: #4.4.4.4 is the Graphiti-episodic memory carrier, the evolving experiential centre that is *also* the system\'s return-point — reviewed activity may, with consent, perturb the field, and the 4-5-0 seam opens to Epii. Per the marketing source, this is where the user \'realizes their personal exploration was always already embedded in a cosmological one\' — the #5→#0 twist where the personal question is recognised as a fractal of the universal. Context completes by deciding whether the whole is ready to return. The world one amassed becomes the threshold one is handed through. The map, complete, reveals it was always mapping the mapper.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:'M4.5'}) SET n.q_1_logos_cycle_engine = 'What M4.5 IS: Nara\'s recursive synthesis engine, running the Logos Cycle (0→5, a-logos through an-a-logos) over each transformation episode to distil it into structured wisdom. Its substance (internalStructure) is six-fold pedagogical architecture: #4.5-0 Curriculum Map (transcendent identity curation — what this person should learn next); #4.5-1 Core Epi-Logos Voice (standardised explanation, the consistent register); #4.5-2–4 Method Transparency (lab-note generation, making the system\'s reasoning auditable); #4.5-5 the Logos Cycle as operational standard. It \'extracts single-line insights from complex experiences, develops reusable playbooks from repeated successes, and continuously evolves the learning curriculum.\' Through privacy-preserving protocols, individual insight contributes to collective wisdom as anonymised Archetype Events — the bridge by which one life\'s learning enriches all, with no narrative or PII crossing the boundary. Raw experience in; insight, playbook, curriculum out. The case becomes the lesson.', n.q_2_distillation_operation = 'M4.5 operates by *distillation* — the 0→5 Logos Cycle executed on each case to extract wisdom and update the curriculum. Its motion is the inner-stroke of the whole personal field raised to its highest power: where M4-3\'s two-stroke seals a single change, M4-5\'s cycle metabolises the entire episode into transferable knowing. Relationally it is the consummating gate: it receives the metabolised change from M4.3 and the multi-lens context from M4.4, runs them through a-logos→an-a-logos, and emits insight + playbook + study-assignment. The how is transparent recursion — method-transparency through lab-notes (#4.5-2–4) so the synthesis is auditable, never an oracle pronouncing from above. On the runtime side this is the LLM-as-Nara surface, the \'traversal-voice\' that \'reads the world through bimba and speaks recognition\' (kernel E4) — the active speaker that articulates the system\'s evaluation back to the user as something they can act on. The operation is teaching born from a single lived case.', n.q_3_recursive_pedagogical_architecture = 'Structurally M4.5 is a recursive pedagogical architecture — a learning loop that modifies the very system it runs inside. Its pattern is the Logos Cycle as standing operator: every Nara episode is fed through the same 0→5 distillation, so the curriculum is not authored once but continuously re-grown from accumulated cases (\'curriculum evolves with understanding\'). The deep structural law is recursive self-modification: insights become playbooks, playbooks refine protocols, refined protocols change how the next episode unfolds — the system reading its own outputs through its own runtime, the personal-scale echo of M0-5\'s cosmic computer where \'the universe computes itself by reading its own instruction-set through its own runtime.\' Its three-tier privacy structure (per-user insight → depersonalised Archetype Event → collective curriculum) is the architecture that lets learning aggregate without surveillance. The form is a spiral that teaches itself: each turn extracts a lesson that bends the next turn. Pedagogy as the system\'s own metabolism.', n.q_4_personal_recapitulates_cosmic = 'M4-5\'s telos is the moment the personal recapitulates the cosmic — the why is \'why experiences matter, what to learn, and how understanding evolves through recursive synthesis.\' This is Nara\'s ascendant flow completed (R1(4)→R4(1)): the individual discovers universal principle *through embodiment* rather than receiving cosmic law from above, the bottom-up divine flow reaching its turn. Its purpose is the marketing source\'s deepest hook: \'via Epii (#5) the user encounters the full system map — the realization that their personal exploration was always already embedded in a cosmological one\', the #5→#0 Möbius where \'my personal question was a fractal of the universal question\', experienced rather than asserted. Contextually M4.5 is the integration-seat of Nara and the bridge to M5: it hands the individual\'s transformation forward to Epii\'s orchestration, the 4-5-0 seam where Nara-as-Jiva meets Epii-as-paidagōgos on the ground of Anuttara. The deeper why is *jīva eva śivaḥ*: the self, fully met, recognised as the whole. Pratyabhijñā as the system\'s purpose.', n.q_5_consummation_reopens_as_ground = 'M4-5\'s synthesis is dialogical consummation — #4.5 as the emergent point where personal work transcends itself into recursive self-modifying symbolic intelligence and is handed to Epii. Read as Nara\'s position-5, its completion is the deepest Möbius of the personal field: the distilled wisdom, the evolved curriculum, the depersonalised Archetype Event re-enter as enriched ground — the person, fully met, \'becomes a co-creator of meaning: the contextual recapitulates the cosmic, and the life becomes ground for the next recognition\' (M4 q_5). This is the 5→0 twist made personal: the same self returns, but the operation upon it is now inverted — the querent who came to be read has become one who reads, the student a teacher of the next case. The seam opens to M5-4\' (Epii review) and M5-5\' (Sophia teaching), and through them the personal episode sediments into the canon it drew from. Nara completes by re-opening: what M4.5 perfects in one life becomes the first ground the next morning — and the next person — stands on. The Logos Cycle\'s last output is a fresh question. The mirror, having shown you your shape, hands you back to the world to move differently.';

// @apply follow the respelling in 2321 relation string properties
MATCH (a:Bimba {coordinate:'L0\''})-[r:`CAUSAL_RESONANCE`]->(b:Bimba {coordinate:'L4-0'}) WHERE r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4-0' SET r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4.0';
MATCH (a:Bimba {coordinate:'L0-0\''})-[r:`CAUSAL_RESONANCE`]->(b:Bimba {coordinate:'L4-0'}) WHERE r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4-0' SET r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4.0';
MATCH (a:Bimba {coordinate:'L0-0\''})-[r:`HOLOGRAPHIC_RESONANCE`]->(b:Bimba {coordinate:'L4-0'}) WHERE r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4-0' SET r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4.0';
MATCH (a:Bimba {coordinate:'L0-1\''})-[r:`CAUSAL_RESONANCE`]->(b:Bimba {coordinate:'L4-1'}) WHERE r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4-1' SET r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4.1';
MATCH (a:Bimba {coordinate:'L0-1\''})-[r:`HOLOGRAPHIC_RESONANCE`]->(b:Bimba {coordinate:'L4-1'}) WHERE r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4-1' SET r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4.1';
MATCH (a:Bimba {coordinate:'L0-2\''})-[r:`CAUSAL_RESONANCE`]->(b:Bimba {coordinate:'L4-2'}) WHERE r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4-2' SET r.c_0_target_coordinate = 'M2-1-4.2';
